# Local font trials only. Fonts the site actually uses live in public/ and
# are tracked, loaded via next/font/local.
#
# The leading slash matters. It anchors this to the repo root, so
# public/fonts/ is NOT ignored. Do not change this to "fonts/": that would
# match public/fonts/ too and the Vercel build would fail on a missing font.
/fonts
